        "docxContentHtml": "<div class='overflow-x-auto my-3'><table class='min-w-full text-xs border border-slate-200 divide-y divide-slate-200 rounded-lg overflow-hidden bg-white'><tr><th class='px-3 py-2 font-bold bg-slate-50 text-slate-700 border-r border-slate-200'>LAB211 Assignment</th><th class='px-3 py-2 font-bold bg-slate-50 text-slate-700 border-r border-slate-200'>Type:</th><th class='px-3 py-2 font-bold bg-slate-50 text-slate-700 border-r border-slate-200'>Long Assignment</th></tr><tr><td class='px-3 py-2 text-slate-600 border-r border-slate-100'></td><td class='px-3 py-2 text-slate-600 border-r border-slate-100'>Code:</td><td class='px-3 py-2 text-slate-600 border-r border-slate-100'>J1.L.P0028</td></tr><tr><td class='px-3 py-2 text-slate-600 border-r border-slate-100'></td><td class='px-3 py-2 text-slate-600 border-r border-slate-100'>LOC:</td><td class='px-3 py-2 text-slate-600 border-r border-slate-100'>200</td></tr><tr><td class='px-3 py-2 text-slate-600 border-r border-slate-100'></td><td class='px-3 py-2 text-slate-600 border-r border-slate-100'>Slot(s):</td><td class='px-3 py-2 text-slate-600 border-r border-slate-100'>5</td></tr></table></div><p class='text-xs text-slate-600 leading-relaxed my-1.5'><b>Title:</b> Traditional Feast Order Management.</p><h4 class='text-sm font-black text-slate-800 mt-4 mb-2 flex items-center gap-2'><span class='w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-blue-500 inline-block'></span>Background Context</h4><p class='text-xs text-slate-600 leading-relaxed my-1.5'>A company offering traditional feast services for special events (such as weddings, anniversaries, and traditional ceremonies) requires a management program. Key features include registering new customers, managing feast menu options, handling orders with integrated payment processing, updating order details, canceling orders, and saving data into a binary file (feast_order_service.dat).</p><h4 class='text-sm font-black text-slate-800 mt-4 mb-2 flex items-center gap-2'><span class='w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-blue-500 inline-block'></span>Program Specifications</h4><div class='p-2.5 my-1.5 rounded-lg bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200/80 font-medium text-xs text-slate-700'>1. Register customers (Customer code C/G/K + 4 digits, Name 2-25 chars, VN 10-digit phone, standard email)</div><div class='p-2.5 my-1.5 rounded-lg bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200/80 font-medium text-xs text-slate-700'>2. Update customer information (Name, phone, email)</div><div class='p-2.5 my-1.5 rounded-lg bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200/80 font-medium text-xs text-slate-700'>3. Search for customer information by name</div><div class='p-2.5 my-1.5 rounded-lg bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200/80 font-medium text-xs text-slate-700'>4. Display feast menus (loaded from feastMenu.csv)</div><div class='p-2.5 my-1.5 rounded-lg bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200/80 font-medium text-xs text-slate-700'>5. Place a feast order (Customer code, set code, tables count, future event date)</div><div class='p-2.5 my-1.5 rounded-lg bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200/80 font-medium text-xs text-slate-700'>6. Update order information</div><div class='p-2.5 my-1.5 rounded-lg bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200/80 font-medium text-xs text-slate-700'>7. Save data to binary file (feast_order_service.dat)</div><div class='p-2.5 my-1.5 rounded-lg bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200/80 font-medium text-xs text-slate-700'>8. Display Customer or Order lists</div>",
