        "docxContentHtml": "<div class='overflow-x-auto my-3'><table class='min-w-full text-xs border border-slate-200 divide-y divide-slate-200 rounded-lg overflow-hidden bg-white'><tr><th class='px-3 py-2 font-bold bg-slate-50 text-slate-700 border-r border-slate-200'>LAB 211 Assignment</th><th class='px-3 py-2 font-bold bg-slate-50 text-slate-700 border-r border-slate-200'>Type:</th><th class='px-3 py-2 font-bold bg-slate-50 text-slate-700 border-r border-slate-200'>Long Assignment</th></tr><tr><td class='px-3 py-2 text-slate-600 border-r border-slate-100'></td><td class='px-3 py-2 text-slate-600 border-r border-slate-100'>Code:</td><td class='px-3 py-2 text-slate-600 border-r border-slate-100'>J1.L.P0039</td></tr><tr><td class='px-3 py-2 text-slate-600 border-r border-slate-100'></td><td class='px-3 py-2 text-slate-600 border-r border-slate-100'>LOC:</td><td class='px-3 py-2 text-slate-600 border-r border-slate-100'>500</td></tr><tr><td class='px-3 py-2 text-slate-600 border-r border-slate-100'></td><td class='px-3 py-2 text-slate-600 border-r border-slate-100'>Slot(s):</td><td class='px-3 py-2 text-slate-600 border-r border-slate-100'>5</td></tr></table></div><p class='text-xs text-slate-600 leading-relaxed my-1.5'><b>Title:</b> Student and Short Course Management System</p><h4 class='text-sm font-black text-slate-800 mt-4 mb-2 flex items-center gap-2'><span class='w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-blue-500 inline-block'></span>Background Context</h4><p class='text-xs text-slate-600 leading-relaxed my-1.5'>A university maintains information about students and the courses they enroll in. To support academic management, the university requires a Java console-based application to manage students and courses, persisting data in Students.txt and Courses.txt.</p><h4 class='text-sm font-black text-slate-800 mt-4 mb-2 flex items-center gap-2'><span class='w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-blue-500 inline-block'></span>Program Specifications</h4><div class='p-2.5 my-1.5 rounded-lg bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200/80 font-medium text-xs text-slate-700'>1. List all students (from Students.txt)</div><div class='p-2.5 my-1.5 rounded-lg bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200/80 font-medium text-xs text-slate-700'>2. Add a new student (ID STU0000, Full name >= 2 words, Major, GPA 0.0-4.0)</div><div class='p-2.5 my-1.5 rounded-lg bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200/80 font-medium text-xs text-slate-700'>3. Update student information</div><div class='p-2.5 my-1.5 rounded-lg bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200/80 font-medium text-xs text-slate-700'>4. Delete student</div><div class='p-2.5 my-1.5 rounded-lg bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200/80 font-medium text-xs text-slate-700'>5. Add course (Course ID unique, Student ID must exist, Duration >= 1 week, Start date in future)</div><div class='p-2.5 my-1.5 rounded-lg bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200/80 font-medium text-xs text-slate-700'>6. List courses</div><div class='p-2.5 my-1.5 rounded-lg bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200/80 font-medium text-xs text-slate-700'>7. Search course by student ID</div><div class='p-2.5 my-1.5 rounded-lg bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200/80 font-medium text-xs text-slate-700'>8. Save data to files (Students.txt, Courses.txt)</div>",
        "docxTextPreview": "LAB 211 Assignment\\nType: Long Assignment\\nCode: J1.L.P0039\\nLOC: 500\\nTitle: Student and Short Course Management System\\nBackground: Java console application to manage students and short courses using OOP. Data is persisted in Students.txt and Courses.txt. Features include student CRUD, course enrollment management, and file persistence.",
